data: {"id": "90a16f8184754757-thinking-parallel_evidence-909", "run_id": "90a16f8184754757", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. 当前异常状态\n- **Pod 状态**: Pending，未进入 Running。\n- **容器状态**: `app` 容器 Waiting，`Reason: CreateContainerConfigError`。\n- **关键事件 (Event)**: `Warning Failed (x12 over 27m): Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`。\n- **Pod Spec**: 定义容器 `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 -c import time; time.sleep(3600)`。\n\n### 2. 配置引用分析 (Spec vs Cluster)\n- **Pod Spec YAML** 中容器定义使用了环境变量或 Volume 挂载来引用 Secret（从 Event 可知引用了 `aiops-c", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789053586167, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

