onfigError` 状态并阻止 Pod 进入 Running 状态。证据（K8s State 报错、Event 日志、Waiting Reason 指标）在维度间高度一致，排除了网络或节点故障。\n\n*注：虽然未能通过工具直接确认 Secret 对象是否存在（工具尝试未返回结果），但 Kubelet 的报错信息本身已构成确证性的失败机制证据，足以定位根因为配置定义与实际可用资源的冲突。*\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9: 36.7s (Evidence 29.5s, RCA 7.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.917, "metrics": {"run_id": "90a16f8184754757", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.92374897003174, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "brea